100 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (In the modern data-driven world, organizations rely on analytical platforms to interpret complex datasets and generate meaningful insights. The objective of this project is to develop an interactive analytics platform capable of exploring global income distribution data and generating predictive insights.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
101 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (The project initially used Microsoft Power BI for visualization of global inequality indicators. However, to enhance flexibility, interactivity, and machine learning integration, the system was extended into a full web application using Streamlit.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
102 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
